  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 3309.06 Issuance of State Labels.\n\n(a) Labels shall be issued by the department.\n\n(b) Agencies shall order labels from the department by completing, signing, and submitting the “Request & Payment for New Hampshire Labels” form DSFM-115, revised 2/2024.\n\n(c) Labels shall be sent to the agency, return receipt requested.\n\n(d) Upon issuing a label, the agency shall forward the label fee, paid for by the manufacturer in accordance with Saf-C 3309.11, to the department.\n\nSource. #5439, eff 7-24-92; ss by #6810, INTERIM, eff 7-25-98, EXPIRES: 11-22-98; ss by #6885, eff 11-18-98;ss by #8741, INTERIM, eff 11-18-06, EXPIRED: 5-17-07\n\nNew. #9752, eff 7-9-10 (from Saf-C 3309.04); ss by #12737, eff 3-8-19",
